rooms_desc ({"You are standing on the front porch of Olav and Emily's house.It's a fully restored, two story Victorian farmhouse surroundedby immaculate lawn and majestic shade trees.To the northeast, you can see a green, roomy pasture borderedby miles of white fencing where Emily's horses are grazing contentedly.","Entering the house, you find yourself in a hallway. A long, curving staircase leads up to the second floor. As you are beinghelped out of your coat by your attentive host, you look around and noticethat everything is both stylish and practical. You feel that no onewould ever ask you not to touch something here.Already you can feel yourself relaxing and feeling at home.","You are in a den. As you look around you see that all thefurniture was selected for comfort, not fashion. It has to be thebest room in the house. Along one wall is a 52\" wide-screen t.v.with surround sound. Next to it is a cabinet with a vcr, segaCD system and hundreds of games and movies, including the entire Disney collection. On the right is a state-of-the-art stereo with massive speakers. An unmatched CD collection surrounds it. As yousink into a reclining chair and put your feet up, you feel likeyou're home. Obviously, Olav has spared no expense here.","This is a swimming pool. It is under construction.","Tihs is gonna be the bed-room. Still under construction.","This is the kitchen, Emily's pride and joy. You admire the spaceand note that she has every modern convenience. The scent of homecooking lingers, causing your mouth to water. A fresh apple piecools on the counter and you long for just a sliver.But just as you reach for a crumb on the counter, a wooden spoon wacks your hand andyou see Emily standing there grinning evilly. With a sigh, you turnto find comfort elsewhere.","You are standing in the nerve center of the house, Olav'soffice. You stare enviously, realizing this could be a scene from aFourtune 500 company. The powerful computer with color lazer printerand modem, the fax machine and triple phone lines. From hereOlav can conduct business world-wide and run his computer companywith ease. you smile as you try to picture outdoors loving Emilyworking here.","You have entered the master bathroom. Ahead of you is thehuge jacuzzi tub just right for two. To your right is the sink andEmily's vanity table neatly cluttered with hair accessories andjewelry. The scent of her perfume lingers, driving you mad with desire. Past the sink is the toilet. On your way out,you glance down at the marble tiles and remember the solidbrass hardware on everything.",0,0,})
